**Interview reasoning.** Rotation closes fixation; `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE` makes it atomic; families turn a silent replay into a detected compromise; dual expiry bounds both "how long since I proved it" and "how long has this session existed"; hashing the stored id means a DB dump is not a session set.

